{"seq":1,"slug":"electricity","title":"电学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-basics","title":"九年级物理 — 电路基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/circuit-basics","wordCount":1153,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"ohms-law","title":"九年级物理 — 欧姆定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/ohms-law","wordCount":1292,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"electrical-power","title":"九年级物理 — 电功率","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/electrical-power","wordCount":1325,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"电学-简介\">电学 简介</h1><p>电学是九年级物理的重头戏，也是中考物理中分值最高的板块。从手机充电到城市供电，从家用电器到工业生产，电无处不在地支撑着现代生活。与八年级学习的力学相比，电学的抽象程度更高——电流看不见摸不着，电压需要借助仪表才能测量——因此更需要同学们通过实验和计算建立扎实的物理直觉。</p>\n<p><strong>电路</strong>一节从最基础的电路元件讲起。电源、导线、开关、用电器如何组成完整的回路，串联电路和并联电路各自有什么特点，电流表和电压表应该怎样正确接入电路——这些是电学大厦的地基。本节特别强调电路图的识读和绘制，因为几乎所有电学计算题都从分析电路开始。</p>\n<p><strong>欧姆定律</strong>一节引入电学中最核心的定量关系：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>U</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = \\frac{U}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个看似简单的公式是整个电学计算的枢纽。本节将通过实验探究的过程推导欧姆定律，训练同学们运用公式分析串并联电路中电流、电压和电阻关系的能力，并讲解电阻的影响因素和变阻器的使用方法。</p>\n<p><strong>电功率</strong>一节在欧姆定律的基础上进一步研究电能的转化与利用。电功、电功率、焦耳定律——这三个概念层层递进，揭示了电能如何转化为热能、光能、机械能。家庭电费怎么算、电器铭牌上的参数代表什么、保险丝为什么能保护电路——这些生活中的问题都能在本节找到物理学的解答。</p>\n<p>电学学习最怕&quot;一知半解就动笔算&quot;。建议同学们拿到题目后先画清电路图，标明已知量和未知量，想清楚用什么公式再下笔，养成严谨的解题习惯。</p>\n"}